<!-- FORREST BLURB -->
<section class="pb-16 bg-[color:var(--warm-white)]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-12 shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-center">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-navy mb-8">About Forrest Woodwick</h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					I'm Forrest Woodwick, and for four years I've been a resource my community can count on — for my neighbors, 
					for fellow voters, and for the volunteers who power our district.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6">
					As Chairman of Legislative District 26, I gave precinct committeemen what they needed to succeed: 
					the knowledge, the tools, and the resources to register voters, educate voters, and elect Republicans. 
					Under my leadership, our volunteers delivered voter guides — in English and Spanish — to an estimated 11,000 voters across LD26. 
					That's not a slogan. That's organized work, done well.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6">
					I lead by showing up. I've worked the polls myself — as a Judge and as an Inspector across our recent elections — 
					doing the unglamorous work that protects every vote.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6">
					I bring 35 years of experience writing, interpreting, and challenging rules at every level of government. 
					I understand how government actually works, and I put that knowledge to work for the people around me.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6">
					And I stand firmly on my principles. I'm a Constitutional conservative and staunchly pro-life — convictions 
					I hold as a biologist who knows life begins at conception and as a Christian who believes every life is cherished from that moment.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-6">
					I build people up, I build the Party up, and I get results doing it. 
					That's the work I'm proud of, and it's the work I intend to keep doing.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

